# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). The crystal mines: a crystal tune over rocking
# vibes and a glockenspiel spark, 6/8, ending on the toy tune.
title    Mines
composer Claude
about    Crystals catching the lamp light, in 6/8: a crystal tune in A minor over a rocking vibraphone and a glockenspiel spark, glass harmonica chords and a low fretless bass; the second half ends on the toy tune (A B C, E D), and the glass bird calls at the phrase ends. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, a woodblock like a pickaxe and a triangle; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    60
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead spark ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart block tri pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -tri horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     crystal    vol=0.75 pan=-0.1
voice spark    glock      vol=0.16 pan=0.45 rev=0.6
voice ost      vibes      vol=0.4  pan=0.3
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice block    block      vol=0.38 pan=0.35
voice tri      tri        vol=0.24 pan=-0.4
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice drive    pizz       vol=0.55 pan=-0.35 gate=0.55 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

